<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nutricia cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nutricia cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said it downgraded NV Verenigde Bedrijven Nutricia to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited Nutricia's Milumil baby milk powder recall in the U.K. and Ireland after a salmonella scare.</p>
<p>-- said did not expect a significant short-term impact on Nutricia's earnings because the recall directly affected a very small proportion of its revenues.</p>
<p>-- However, J.P. Morgan said customer concern over the recall could carry over to some of Nutricia's other baby milk lines in Europe.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
